<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-475c2881 elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="475c2881" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container"> <h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Bring Bougie Barbecue Home</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1027a31 e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="1027a31" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d9a74b0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="d9a74b0" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ee74cbe elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="ee74cbe" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container"> <p>Bougie Barbecue is more than just food—it’s a brand and a lifestyle that blends soulful tradition with modern sophistication. It’s about transforming barbecue into an experience where every detail matters, from the perfectly smoked meats to the elevated sides, bold flavors, and the way you show up to the grill. Bougie Barbecue isn’t just what’s on the plate—it’s the entire vibe. From rolling out custom Bougie BBQ rigs that make a statement to dressing bougie while barbecuing—because who says you can’t look good while tending the fire?—it’s all about serving style, confidence, and unforgettable flavor.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ed4b827 elementor-grid-3 elementor-grid-tablet-3 elementor-grid-mobile-2 elementor-products-grid elementor-wc-products elementor-widget elementor-widget-woocommerce-products" data-id="ed4b827" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="woocommerce-products.default">
